  "article": [
    { "en": "After reading an article about cigarette smoking, I lit a cigarette to calm my nerves.", "zh": "读完一篇关于吸烟的文章后，我点燃了一支香烟来镇定神经。" },
    { "en": "I smoked with pleasure, for I was sure that this would be my last cigarette.", "zh": "我津津有味地吸着，因为我确信这将是我最后一支烟。" },
    { "en": "For a whole week I did not smoke at all, and my wife suffered terribly.", "zh": "整整一个星期我一支烟也没抽，我妻子可受了不少罪。" },
    { "en": "I had all the usual symptoms of giving up smoking: a bad temper and an enormous appetite.", "zh": "戒烟的人常有的症状我全都有：脾气暴躁、胃口大增。" },
    { "en": "My friends kept on offering me cigarettes and cigars.", "zh": "我的朋友们不断地给我递香烟和雪茄。" },
    { "en": "They laughed loudly whenever I produced a packet of sweets from my pocket.", "zh": "每当我从口袋里掏出一包糖果，他们就哈哈大笑。" },
    { "en": "After seven days of this, I went to a party, and everybody around me was smoking.", "zh": "这样过了七天之后，我去参加了一个聚会，我周围人人都在吸烟。" },
    { "en": "When my old friend Brian urged me to accept a cigarette, it was more than I could bear.", "zh": "当我的老朋友布赖恩极力劝我接一支烟时，我再也忍不住了。" },
    { "en": "I took one guiltily, lit it and smoked with satisfaction.", "zh": "我内疚地接过一支，点上火，心满意足地吸了起来。" },
    { "en": "Anyway, as Brian pointed out, it is the easiest thing in the world to give up smoking — he has done it lots of times!", "zh": "不管怎样，正如布赖恩指出的那样，戒烟是世界上最容易的事情——他已经戒过很多次了！" }
